      "raw": "<p>Hey everyone</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just wanted to put out a public thank-you to the &gt;G team for making the pilgrimage out to Australia for PAX this last weekend. You had a super popular booth, and I saw lots of people playing SotM around your booth, as weel as elsewhere at the con - There were copies in the Tabletop library for poeple to check out, and they were almost always in use.</p><p>&gt;G also managed to sell all of their stuff (Base game was sold out by mid-Saturday, everything else was gone by the time I saw the booth Sunday).</p><p>I got to say Hi to Christopher, which was cool, even though he was super busy. He remembers my villain contest entry, too. Squee.</p><p>There was a post on twitter that they&#39;d auctioned off all their booth stuff, including a surprise - I didn&#39;t see it until too late - does anyone know what the surprise was?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, kickass showing, guys. Hope to see you next year.</p>",
